<title>USA: Raytheon says won $484 mln Saudi contract.</title>
<headline>Raytheon says won $484 mln Saudi contract.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Ky. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raytheon Co on Tuesday said it won a $484 million technical suppport contract to assist Saudi Arabia in managing its Patriot and Hawk air defense systems.</p>
<p>A Raytheon spokeswoman said the contract was awarded at the end of March and had already been reflected in its backlog.</p>
<p>The contract extends through December 1999, it said.</p>
</text>
